      "prompt": "<p>Check that the solution above really solves the given equations.</p>",
      "answer": {
        "type": "open",
        "generated_by": "ai",
        "solution": "Put $\\kxone = -4$, $\\kxtwo = 3$, $\\kxthree = 2$ into each equation. The first: $2(-4) + 2(3) + 2(2) = -8 + 6 + 4 = 2$. The second: $-4 + 3 + 3(2) = 5$. The third: $-4 + 4(3) + 2 = 10$. Each left-hand side equals its right-hand side, so $\\kxone = -4$, $\\kxtwo = 3$, $\\kxthree = 2$ solves the system."
