      "prompt": "<p>Solve $\\left[ \\begin{smallmatrix} 3 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 4 & 3 \\end{smallmatrix} \\right] \\kvecx = \\left[ \\begin{smallmatrix} 2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1 \\end{smallmatrix} \\right]$.</p>",
      "answer": {
